   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Max serves his special soup to the Claude Monet kitchen crew, but it turns out to be an alarming bright blue color. The cooks are skeptical, pastry chef Louis suddenly notices his missing food dye, but the bizarre soup turns out to be surprisingly delicious. Listen to their conversation in Russian first, then we will break down each line in English.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
