  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Now let us go through each phrase to see how it works in Russian.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Что это за странное блюдо?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'What kind of strange dish is this?' The cook stares in disbelief at the oddly colored food.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Это мой новый вкусный суп!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'This is my new delicious soup!' Max introduces his culinary invention with great pride.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Почему он такого синего цвета?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Why is it such a blue color?' An obvious question about the soup's unnatural bright hue.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Это оригинальный авторский рецепт.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'This is an original creator's recipe.' Russian omits the present-tense verb 'to be' here, linking 'original' directly with 'author's', combining 'original' with 'author's' and 'recipe'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Спасибо, я сегодня на диете.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Thanks, I am on a diet today.' An excuse to politely decline trying the suspect blue meal.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Подожди, это действительно очень вкусно!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Wait, this is really very delicious!' Max pleads with everyone to look beyond the appearance.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "louis",
   "t": "Пардон, это же мой краситель!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Pardon, that is my food coloring!' The French pastry chef recognizes his missing ingredient.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "louis",
   "t": "Я так долго его искал!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I looked for it for so long!' Louis reveals that a bottle of blue dye had gone missing.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Подождите, вы куда все уходите?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Wait, where are you all going?' Max sees his audience backing away from the table.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Мы не хотим есть химию.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'We do not want to eat chemicals.' The cooks refuse to ingest artificial baking dye.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Но это же реально вкусно!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'But this is actually delicious!' Max insists that the dish tastes wonderful despite the color.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Какой интересный красивый супчик.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'What an interesting pretty little soup.' A brave cook takes a spoonful and reconsiders.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Как будто прямо море ешь.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Like you are eating the sea directly.' The flavor surprisingly evokes an oceanic essence.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
